      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">65 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 37 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Customer Issue Resolution (PhonePe)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">PhonePe's favourite machine-coding problem: customers raise complaints against failed or pending transactions, the system routes each issue to an agent with the right expertise, agents work on one issue at a time, busy agents collect a waitlist, and admins see each agent's work history. You get the requirements, entities, class and sequence diagrams, the issue state machine, an assignment Strategy you can swap, composable filters, running Java, Python and C++14 code, a 90-minute plan and the review-call questions on concurrency.</p>\n"
